{
  "name": "ZHHProgressHUD",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "summary": "iOS Loading HUD + Toast：可按需安装 Loading 或 Toast。",
  "description": "ZHHProgressHUD 是一套「双子产品」：\n\n• Loading：活动指示器、进度、遮罩与转场\n• Toast：轻提示、队列、主题态、遮罩与阴影\n\n默认安装全量（`Source` subspec，Development Pods 中单组展示源码树）。\n也可只装 Loading 或 Toast：\n\n  pod 'ZHHProgressHUD/Loading'\n  pod 'ZHHProgressHUD/Toast'\n\n应用内消息卡片请使用独立库 [ZHHInAppMessage](https://github.com/yue5yueliang/ZHHInAppMessage)。\n\n无第三方依赖，仅依赖系统 UIKit / QuartzCore。",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/yue5yueliang/ZHHProgressHUD",
  "license": {
    "type": "MIT",
    "file": "LICENSE"
  },
  "authors": {
    "桃色三岁": "136769890@qq.com"
  },
  "source": {
    "git": "https://github.com/yue5yueliang/ZHHProgressHUD.git",
    "tag": "0.2.0"
  },
  "platforms": {
    "ios": "15.0"
  },
  "swift_versions": "5.0",
  "frameworks": [
    "UIKit",
    "QuartzCore"
  ],
  "resource_bundles": {
    "ZHHProgressHUD": [
      "ZHHProgressHUD/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy"
    ]
  },
  "default_subspecs": "Source",
  "subspecs": [
    {
      "name": "Source",
      "source_files": "ZHHProgressHUD/Classes/**/*"
    },
    {
      "name": "Loading",
      "source_files": [
        "ZHHProgressHUD/Classes/Core/**/*",
        "ZHHProgressHUD/Classes/Loading/**/*"
      ],
      "exclude_files": "ZHHProgressHUD/Classes/Loading/ZHHProgressHUD+Toast.swift"
    },
    {
      "name": "Toast",
      "source_files": [
        "ZHHProgressHUD/Classes/Core/**/*",
        "ZHHProgressHUD/Classes/Toast/**/*"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "swift_version": "5.0"
}
